{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1095404-question-about-saining","id":1095404,"title":"Question about Saining","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-22T01:22:19-07:00","id":1095404,"title":"Question about Saining","content":"The cantrip Saining (p. 212) says: &quot;Once she discern the subject's True Name, she receives a -5 to the difficulties of all cantrips and contested rolls where magic is involved with the target&quot;<br /> <br /> If every changeling knows her own True Name, then, when you cast a cantrip or magical effect on yourself is always at -5 diffcultty?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13413-akabalor","name":"AKABalor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T01:56:49-07:00","id":1095409,"title":"","content":"No think more to thwart the target whose name you know. Though possibly making it easier to smite yourself with lightning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T08:40:27-07:00","id":1095493,"title":"","content":"Then, If I want to use Holly-Strike upon somebody I'd have -5.<br /> What about if I want to heal her with Well of Life?<br /> Or Oakenshield to protect her?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13413-akabalor","name":"AKABalor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T08:56:05-07:00","id":1095503,"title":"","content":"I'm afraid I have to disagree with Eldagusto. If you have taken the time to know yourself then you should benefit. Mind you, as far as I know, there are no inherent protections against that name being ripped from you if someone realizes you are using it. As far as Well of Life and Oakenshield they should be equally impacted. <br /> <br /> I would say it is incumbent upon the ST to remind players, who allow themselves to be stained, that they are opening up their soul to this person and offering them easy influence over it. Though my players are most often friends and they would recognize the value of another player with knowledge of their true name... I daresay most would balk at that level of intimacy. Too often in my games players are influenced to attack each other... ahhh good times.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1383-yrtalien","name":"yrtalien","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T14:54:57-07:00","id":1095621,"title":"","content":"That's a good point. Knowing your true name isn't automatic, your given name is not your true name, and anyone who knows your true name can be forced to give it up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13395-daniel-knight","name":"Daniel Knight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T15:03:30-07:00","id":1095625,"title":"","content":"do I need to know the Cantrip myself to enjoy the bonus, or can someone else tell me the true name?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T15:14:48-07:00","id":1095630,"title":"","content":"I would say that grokking someone's true name involves more than just sounds. That study imparts a deeper knowledge that the &quot;sounds&quot; help you visualize (or somesuch hocum) <br /> <br /> So avoiding the pitfalls of dramatic explanation... I would require the catnip AND the time put into study to get benefit. That's just me though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1383-yrtalien","name":"yrtalien","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T15:27:06-07:00","id":1095633,"title":"","content":"I would consider allowing Naming 1 to allow you to understand someone telling you a true name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13395-daniel-knight","name":"Daniel Knight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}